  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "In acidic medium,\r\n$$\r\n\\mathrm{K}_{2} \\mathrm{Cr}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{7} \\longrightarrow \\mathrm{Cr}^{3+}\r\n$$\r\nEquivalent weight of $\\mathrm{K}_{2} \\mathrm{Cr}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{7}=\\frac{\\text { Molecular weight }}{\\text { Change in oxidation state of } \\mathrm{c}}$\r\n$$\r\n=\\frac{M}{2(6-3)}=\\frac{M}{6}\r\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
